WEBVTT

00:02.500 --> 00:06.500
My name is Amir Emadi, I'm the co-founder and CEO of Airwai.

00:06.500 --> 00:09.000
I've been in autonomous technologies,

00:09.000 --> 00:11.300
artificial intelligence and machine learning

00:11.300 --> 00:14.000
for the last 15 years, deploying technologies

00:14.000 --> 00:16.400
in critical infrastructure

00:16.400 --> 00:19.600
for defense and for our public safety agencies.

00:20.100 --> 00:21.950
Airwai was built to move fast,

00:22.000 --> 00:27.850
rapidly deploying frontier technologies
in AI, robotics and predictive analytics.

00:28.500 --> 00:33.400
Airwai started in California,
but we chose Albania as our European hub

00:33.450 --> 00:36.500
because of the extraordinary potential here.

00:36.600 --> 00:40.350
From smart cities, to renewable energy, to healthcare,

00:40.400 --> 00:44.050
this is a place where innovation can flourish.

00:44.100 --> 00:48.350
Albania has brilliant engineers and scientists
who want to build,

00:48.400 --> 00:54.650
and our mission is to give them the opportunities
to create world-class AI solutions at home.
